  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Measures 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective is to contribute to a stronger and more effective EU-Bolivia partnership, enhancing the impact of the interventions programmed or implemented within the Multi-Annual Indicative Programme (MIP) for Bolivia 2021-2027, the Joint European Strategy (JES) 2022-2025, the Bolivian Team Europe Initiative (TEI) &#xbf;Green and Resilient Development&#xbf;, regional TEIs and other programmes and strategic documents (as the Roadmap for civil society, Gender Action Plan, Global Gateway, etc).The Specific Objectives are to:- &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Support the effective and efficient identification, formulation, implementation and evaluation of EU international cooperation actions and policies-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Improve synergies and coherence with other EU and Team Europe actions -&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Support policy dialogues and engagement with Government and other stakeholders-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Strengthen strategic communication and public diplomacy, including visibility actions on EU cooperation and public diplomacy specific interventions to promote EU policies as well as its multilateral agenda in Bolivia</narrative>
  </description>
